📊 SQL 查詢語句說明
以下是系統處理用戶查詢時使用的 SQL 語句：
1️⃣ 驗證 Skill 存在 (get_documents_for_skill)
-- 檢查 skill_id 是否有關聯的文件映射
SELECT file_id, relevance_score, created_at
FROM skill_document_mapping
WHERE skill_id = ?
ORDER BY relevance_score DESC
用途: 確認用戶選擇的 skill 存在且有文件
2️⃣ 獲取 Skill 詳細資訊 (get_skill)
-- 獲取 skill 的完整 metadata
SELECT * FROM skill_metadata 
WHERE skill_id = ?
用途: 取得 skill_name、source_file 等資訊
3️⃣ 獲取 Skill Tree 結構
-- 獲取所有 skill heads (技能分組)
SELECT head_id, skill_name, description, category, 
       display_order, enabled, created_at, updated_at
FROM skill_heads
WHERE enabled = 1
ORDER BY display_order ASC, skill_name ASC

-- 獲取每個 head 下的文件
SELECT skill_id, skill_name, skill_description, skill_category,
       total_chunks, source_name, parent_skill_id, head_id,
       created_at, updated_at
FROM skill_metadata
WHERE head_id = ?
ORDER BY created_at ASC
用途: 建立前端 sidebar 的技能樹結構
4️⃣ 獲取 Chunk 內容 (用於調試)
-- 查看特定 skill 的 chunk 內容
SELECT skill_id, document_name, chunk_index, 
       substr(chunk_text, 1, 200) as preview
FROM skill_chunk_metadata
WHERE skill_id = ?
ORDER BY chunk_index ASC
LIMIT 10
用途: 調試時檢查 chunk 內容是否正確
